> Looks fine to me, except for this:
> 
> > 6.  I, some other bay area Lojbanists, and a *very* few people
> > via voice chat, sit down for serious, concentrated sessions of
> > Making A Dictionary, hopefully using the next generation of
> > jbovlaste, which someone has written in the meantime.  We
